    "concurrency": "Body clips mutually exclusive. Face blink is composable; no other additive transform. All lifetime bounds include bob once."
  },
  "fallbackTiming": "An alias borrows ONLY the visual frame. The requested clip retains its own loop/duration and completes normally; never wait on the idle alias loop. Reduced motion uses static visual frames while requested clip completion/hold timers remain unchanged.",
